# Curse of the Werefox: the spell's one target must be a creature Bot1 controls (Bot2's Hill Giant is refused, CR 115.1), and the
# fight is "up to one target creature you don't control": with the reflexive ability (CR 603.12) triggered, Bot1's own Memnite is
# refused as its target (CR 115.4) and choosing none is allowed. Nothing fights, so neither Bot2's Hill Giant nor the Bears, which
# keeps the Monster Role (+1/+1 and trample), is damaged.

